# A concise description of what this element means (e.g. for use in autogenerated summaries).
#: StructureDefinition.element.AllergyIntolerance.clinicalStatus/short
msgid "This field indicates the current clinical status of the allergy or intolerance."
msgstr "Ushbu element allergiya yoki o'zlashtira olmaslikning joriy klinik statusini ko'rsatadi."

# A concise description of what this element means (e.g. for use in autogenerated summaries).
#: StructureDefinition.element.AllergyIntolerance.verificationStatus/short
msgid "This field reflects how well the reported allergy has been confirmed."
msgstr "Ushbu element qayd etilgan allergiya qanchalik tasdiqlanganini ko'rsatadi."

# A concise description of what this element means (e.g. for use in autogenerated summaries).
#: StructureDefinition.element.AllergyIntolerance.type/short
msgid "The type field in the Uz DHP AllergyIntolerance resource indicates whether the patient's condition is an allergy or an intolerance."
msgstr "Uz DHP AllergyIntolerance resursidagi type elementi bemorning holati allergiya yoki o'zlashtira olmaslik ekanini ko'rsatadi."

# A concise description of what this element means (e.g. for use in autogenerated summaries).
#: StructureDefinition.element.AllergyIntolerance.code/short
msgid "Code identifying the allergy or intolerance. This is the allergen itself, i.e., the substance to which the patient is allergic."
msgstr "Allergiya yoki o'zlashtira olmaslikni identifikatsiya qiluvchi kod. Bu allergenning o'zi, ya'ni bemor allergik reaksiya bildiradigan modda."

